# Judge3-5-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:第一次声响<br>是在深夜【1点】。<br>因为我当时正好<br>看了手机的时间，<br>这一点我可以完全确定。|#0103Trial05_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:【1点】的时候<br>听到了一声<br>类似【爆裂】<br>或者【爆炸】的声响……|#0103Trial05_Alisa002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"声音有点像<link=\"Objection_01_03_05_01\">鞭炮</link>，<br>而且只响了<br>【1次】。|#0103Trial05_Alisa003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你还记得声音<br>是从哪个方向传来的吗？|#0103Trial05_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"我记得应该是<br>从<link=\"Objection_01_03_05_02\">仓库</link>那个方向传来的……<br>虽然不能百分百确定。|#0103Trial05_Alisa004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"至于另一个声响……<br>是在深夜【<link=\"Objection_01_03_05_03\">2点</link>】左右的<br>时候。|#0103Trial05_Alisa005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这个声音……<br>我很难准确描述<br>是什么。<br>不像是<br>爆炸声……<br>但在很短的时间内<br>连续响了两三次……<br>反正记得是响了几下。|#0103Trial05_Alisa006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"会不会是发生了<br>【<link=\"Objection_01_03_05_04\">直下型地震</link>】呢？<br>毕竟现场<br>房间里的家具<br>都东倒西歪的。|#0103Trial05_Margo001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Serious_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:啊，<br>确实有点像……<br>不过，<br>当时并没有感觉到<br>任何震动。|#0103Trial05_Alisa007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:如果真的发生地震的话，<br>不可能只有你一个人<br>注意到的吧。<br>会不会是你听错了？|#0103Trial05_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"什么……！？<br>怎么可能会听错……！<br>你有什么<br><br><link=\"Objection_01_03_05_05\">证据证明我听错了</link>吗！？|#0103Trial05_Alisa008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4


